{"title": "Rivington Rats", "pageid": 58366, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Rivington_Rats", "categories": ["Factions"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p>The <b>Rivington Rats</b>, or just Rats<sup id=\"cite_ref-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup> are a gang affiliated with <a href=\"/wiki/The_Guild\" title=\"The Guild\">The Guild</a> residing in <a href=\"/wiki/Rivington\" title=\"Rivington\">Rivington</a> during <a href=\"/wiki/Act_Three\" title=\"Act Three\">Act Three</a>.\n</p>\n<style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r356266\">.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote{display:grid;margin:10px 4px}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-blockquote-left,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-blockquote-right{padding:8px 16px;margin:auto}@media screen and (max-width:779px){.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-blockquote-left,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-blockquote-right{margin-top:10px;padding:8px 2px;border-left:0!important;grid-row:2;grid-column:2}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-image-right,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-image-left{margin:auto;grid-row:1;grid-column:2}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-author{grid-row:3;grid-column:2}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote{justify-content:center!important}}@media screen and (min-width:780px){.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-blockquote-left{margin-left:10px;border-left:2px solid #3d3d3d!important;grid-row:1;grid-column:2}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-blockquote-right{margin-right:10px;border-left:0!important;border-right:2px solid #3d3d3d;grid-row:1;grid-column:2}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-image-right{margin:auto 0;grid-row:1;grid-column:3}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-image-left{margin:auto 0;grid-row:1;grid-column:1}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-author{grid-row:2;grid-column:2}}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-author{margin-left:auto;margin-right:32px;font-size:smaller;font-weight:bold}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-begin,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-end{font-size:300%;font-family:serif;color:#3d3d3d;line-height:1em}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-begin{margin-bottom:auto;margin-right:8px}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-end{margin-top:auto;margin-left:8px}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-text{font-style:italic}</style><div class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote\" style=\"justify-content: center\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-image-left\" style=\"display: inline-block; height: calc(70px + 2*4px); width: calc(70px + 2*4px); clip-path: polygon(50% 0%, 100% 50%, 50% 100%, 0% 50%); background: black;\"><span style=\"display: inline-block; margin: 4px; width: 70px; height: 70px; clip-path: polygon(50% 0%, 100% 50%, 50% 100%, 0% 50%);\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Zenovia_Dawg\" title=\"Zenovia Dawg\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/67/Portrait_Zenovia_Dawg.png/70px-Portrait_Zenovia_Dawg.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/67/Portrait_Zenovia_Dawg.png/105px-Portrait_Zenovia_Dawg.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/67/Portrait_Zenovia_Dawg.png/140px-Portrait_Zenovia_Dawg.png.webp 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/67/Portrait_Zenovia_Dawg.png/70px-Portrait_Zenovia_Dawg.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"70\" height=\"70\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/67/Portrait_Zenovia_Dawg.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><blockquote style=\"font-size: 100%\" class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-blockquote-left\">\n  <div style=\"display: flex; align-items: center\">\n     <div class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-begin\">“</div>\n     <div class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-text\">Boys - how about a bit of the Rivington Rats' famous hospitality for our friend here?</div>\n     <div class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-end\">„</div>\n  </div>\n</blockquote><div class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-author\">— <a href=\"/wiki/Zenovia_Dawg\" title=\"Zenovia Dawg\">Zenovia Dawg</a></div><div style=\"grid-column:3\"></div></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Involvement\">Involvement</span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Act_Three\">Act Three</span></h3>\n<p>The Rivington Rats are a gang in front of <a href=\"/wiki/Arfur%27s_Mansion\" title=\"Arfur's Mansion\">Arfur's Mansion</a>. They were paid by <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Arfur_Gregorio\" title=\"Arfur Gregorio\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3b/Portrait_Arfur_Gregorio.png/25px-Portrait_Arfur_Gregorio.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3b/Portrait_Arfur_Gregorio.png/38px-Portrait_Arfur_Gregorio.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/3b/Portrait_Arfur_Gregorio.png/50px-Portrait_Arfur_Gregorio.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Arfur Gregorio\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3b/Portrait_Arfur_Gregorio.png/25px-Portrait_Arfur_Gregorio.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/3b/Portrait_Arfur_Gregorio.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Arfur_Gregorio\" title=\"Arfur Gregorio\">Arfur Gregorio</a> to bring him safely to his home but Arfur now demands the group to eject the squatters from his mansion. The gang's leader <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Zenovia_Dawg\" title=\"Zenovia Dawg\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/67/Portrait_Zenovia_Dawg.png/25px-Portrait_Zenovia_Dawg.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/67/Portrait_Zenovia_Dawg.png/38px-Portrait_Zenovia_Dawg.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/67/Portrait_Zenovia_Dawg.png/50px-Portrait_Zenovia_Dawg.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Zenovia Dawg\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/67/Portrait_Zenovia_Dawg.png/25px-Portrait_Zenovia_Dawg.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/67/Portrait_Zenovia_Dawg.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Zenovia_Dawg\" title=\"Zenovia Dawg\">Zenovia Dawg</a> reminds him that she and her group were only paid to act as caravan guards and that anything more will cost extra. The party can help Arfur remove the squatters, or insist he leave them be. If the party help the squatters, Arfur offers Zenovia's crew gold to attack them.\n</p><p>The rats have an informant named <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Earspoon\" title=\"Earspoon\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f1/Portrait_Earspoon.png/25px-Portrait_Earspoon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f1/Portrait_Earspoon.png/38px-Portrait_Earspoon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f1/Portrait_Earspoon.png/50px-Portrait_Earspoon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Earspoon\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f1/Portrait_Earspoon.png/25px-Portrait_Earspoon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/f1/Portrait_Earspoon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Earspoon\" title=\"Earspoon\">Earspoon</a> who is in <a href=\"/wiki/Sharess%27_Caress\" title=\"Sharess' Caress\">Sharess' Caress</a> in <a href=\"/wiki/Wyrm%27s_Crossing\" title=\"Wyrm's Crossing\">Wyrm's Crossing</a>.\n</p><p>When the party first meet <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Nine-Fingers_Keene\" title=\"Nine-Fingers Keene\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/56/Portrait_Nine-Fingers_Keene.png/25px-Portrait_Nine-Fingers_Keene.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/56/Portrait_Nine-Fingers_Keene.png/38px-Portrait_Nine-Fingers_Keene.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/56/Portrait_Nine-Fingers_Keene.png/50px-Portrait_Nine-Fingers_Keene.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Nine-Fingers Keene\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/56/Portrait_Nine-Fingers_Keene.png/25px-Portrait_Nine-Fingers_Keene.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/56/Portrait_Nine-Fingers_Keene.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Nine-Fingers_Keene\" title=\"Nine-Fingers Keene\">Nine-Fingers Keene</a> they can remark on having encountered the Rivington Rats and refer to them as thugs.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Members\">Members</span></h2>\n<style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r347748\">.mw-parser-output .div-col{margin-top:0.3em;column-width:20em}.mw-parser-output .div-col>ul{list-style-type:inherit}.mw-parser-output .div-col-rules{column-rule:1px solid #aaa}.mw-parser-output .div-col dl,.mw-parser-output .div-col ol,.mw-parser-output .div-col ul{margin-top:0}.mw-parser-output .div-col li,.mw-parser-output .div-col dd{page-break-inside:avoid;break-inside:avoid-column}</style><div class=\"div-col\">\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Dimples_Backster\" title=\"Dimples Backster\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/39/Portrait_Dimples_Backster.png/30px-Portrait_Dimples_Backster.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/39/Portrait_Dimples_Backster.png/45px-Portrait_Dimples_Backster.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/39/Portrait_Dimples_Backster.png/60px-Portrait_Dimples_Backster.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Dimples Backster\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/39/Portrait_Dimples_Backster.png