age link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Gleeful_Clong\" title=\"Gleeful Clong\">Gleeful Clong</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Scarpers\" title=\"Scarpers\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ab/Portrait_Scarpers.png/30px-Portrait_Scarpers.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/ab/Portrait_Scarpers.png/45px-Portrait_Scarpers.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/ab/Portrait_Scarpers.png/60px-Portrait_Scarpers.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Scarpers\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ab/Portrait_Scarpers.png/30px-Portrait_Scarpers.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/ab/Portrait_Scarpers.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Scarpers\" title=\"Scarpers\">Scarpers</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Zenovia_Dawg\" title=\"Zenovia Dawg\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/67/Portrait_Zenovia_Dawg.png/30px-Portrait_Zenovia_Dawg.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/67/Portrait_Zenovia_Dawg.png/45px-Portrait_Zenovia_Dawg.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/67/Portrait_Zenovia_Dawg.png/60px-Portrait_Zenovia_Dawg.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Zenovia Dawg\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/67/Portrait_Zenovia_Dawg.png/30px-Portrait_Zenovia_Dawg.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/67/Portrait_Zenovia_Dawg.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Zenovia_Dawg\" title=\"Zenovia Dawg\">Zenovia Dawg</a> - leader</li></ul>\n</div>\n<div class=\"navbox-styles\"><style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r138587\">.mw-parser-output .hlist dl,.mw-parser-ou